    <selectionEntry name="Warpfire Mantle" id="bd54-ceae-4e4e-140d" hidden="false" import="true" type="upgrade">
      <profiles>
        <profile name="Warpfire Mantle" id="10ea-2f40-1afc-1e3a" hidden="false" typeId="2a1f-7837-f0ef-be44" typeName="Wargear Item">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="347e-ee4a-764f-6be3">A model equipped with a Warpfire Mantle gains a 5+ Invulnerable save and the ‘Feel no Pain (5+)’ special rule. 
Additionally, At the end any Shooting Phase, in which one or more models with Warpfire Mantles passed at least one Armour or Invulnerable save, every unit with at least one Model within 8&quot; of at least one Model in that Unit must make a Toughness Check, unless it contains any Models with a Warpfire Mantle. A Unit which fails this Toughness Check suffers D3 automatic wounds at AP2 as if they were inflicted by a Shooting Attack.
Finally, when a model with this wargear is removed as a casualty, roll a dice and on a 4+ all models which are not equipped with a Warpfire Mantle within d6” suffer a S6 AP- hit.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
    </selectionEntry>
